%--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
% readme_Lorenz_system_v.txt 
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
% This directory contains programs related with NGRC DDE learned from the
% Lorenz system; 
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
% We compute the Tvp=Tvp(Lc) statistics for many various random 
% initial conditions;
% Tvp -> valid prediction time;
% Lc -> Conditional Lyapunov Exponent (CLE);
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Here we compute the statistics of valid prediction
% vs CLE (Lc) for NGRC DDE system learned by the Lorenz system; the statistics arise
% due to random initial conditions on chaotic attractor; the
% case without imposing CLE is also included;
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Lorenz_signal.m -> this function computes the time series of variable x(t) of
% exact Lorenz system; this function is used by the file 
% [plot_Lorenz_signal_v2.m]; 
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
% plot_Lorenz_signal_v2.m -> this file computes the time series of variable x(t) 
% of exact Lorenz system; this data of time series is subsequently saved 
% in a data file; this file uses the function [Lorenz_signal.m];
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
% plot_Lorenz_signal.m -> this file computes and plots the time series of
% variable x(t) of exact Lorenz system; the computed dynamics are plotted 
% in a graph; this file uses the function [Lorenz_signal.m];
% this file differs from file [plot_Lorenz_signal_v2.m] by the fact that it
% computes and plots much shorter x(t) dynamics;
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Lorenz_scan_Lc_aut_v.m -> this file computes the statistics of valid prediction
% time Tvp vs the CLE Lc; for each value of Lc we perform 500 numerical experiments,
% with random initial conditions on the chaotic attractor; the computed data are
% saved in the data file; 
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Lor_ngrc_psd_v2.m -> this file plots the PSD for the x(t) time series from the
% exact and from the NGRC DDE system learned from the Lorenz system; 
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
% These files are auxiliary functions for the NGRC DDE system:
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
% generate_all_exp_matreces.m
% generateCheb_feat_vect.m
% generateChebyshevs.m
% generateChebyshevsDiffLyap.m
% genExponents.m
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
% matr.mat -> contains power matrices necessary for composing Tschebyshev
% polynomials;
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
% WelchPowerSpectralDensity.m -> this function computes the PSD of 
% underlying time series by using the FFT method; this function
% uses the auxillary function [Hann.m];
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Hann.m -> this is an auxillary function used by the function
% [WelchPowerSpectralDensity.m];
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------



